sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Developer
    participant Browser as Browser Client
    participant Server as FastAPI Server
    participant FS as File System

    Note over Browser: Markdown card rendered in view mode

    User->>Browser: Click pencil/edit icon on markdown card
    Note over Browser: Switch to edit mode:<br/>textarea with raw markdown,<br/>save + cancel buttons visible

    User->>Browser: Edit markdown content
    User->>Browser: Click save (checkmark) button
    Note over Browser: Show saving indicator

    Browser->>Server: PUT /api/projects/{id}/features/{name}/arch/{filename}
    Server->>FS: Validate path within arch/ directory

    alt Path traversal attempted
        Server-->>Browser: 400 Forbidden
        Note over Browser: Show error, keep edit mode
    else File not found
        Server-->>Browser: 404 Not Found
        Note over Browser: Show error, keep edit mode
    else Success
        FS-->>Server: File written
        Server-->>Browser: 200 OK
        Note over Browser: Brief success indicator,<br/>switch back to rendered view
    end

    User->>Browser: Click cancel (X) button
    Note over Browser: Discard edits,<br/>revert to last-saved rendered view
